# The scenario responses are FIXTURES, not output. See tag-scenarios/.gitignore for the same note.
#
# The root `*.out` rule (line 142) was already swallowing these: a fresh clone received only the four
# scenarios that happen to contain a .err or .rc file, and 02 through 08 -- every scenario whose whole content
# is a single .out -- did not exist as directories at all. The replay reported 12 green locally and could not
# have run anywhere else.
!*.out
!**/*.out
